{"4328440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cat Parents", "steam_appid": 4328440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your heart is full of love. The city is full of cats who need it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save abandoned, homeless, and helpless cats. Give them care, earn their trust, and help them find a forever home - or keep them with you and build a safe sanctuary where they can live happily. Play alone or together with your own team of cat parents.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SAVE CATS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locate cats in distress on the open city map. Ride your bike on a rescue mission. Use the right tools and gadgets. Save poor, sweet little animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every rescue is unique. Every life matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4328440/extras/4839cfa7578775c48945aa38fdfd5e7b.poster.avif?t=1774263285\" width=640 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4328440/extras/4839cfa7578775c48945aa38fdfd5e7b.webm?t=1774263285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4328440/extras/4839cfa7578775c48945aa38fdfd5e7b.mp4?t=1774263285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TAKE CARE OF THEM</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring rescued cats home and give them gentle care: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• wash dirty and scared cats </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• treat illnesses </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• feed them </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• help them feel safe again</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4328440/extras/2cde11fd6247a9ce81050443010ffc43.poster.avif?t=1774263285\" width=640 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4328440/extras/2cde11fd6247a9ce81050443010ffc43.webm?t=1774263285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4328440/extras/2cde11fd6247a9ce81050443010ffc43.mp4?t=1774263285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR CAT PARADISE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your home into a true cat sanctuary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• build climbing structures, tunnels, beds, and houses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• decorate and expand your space</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• create a cozy, living ecosystem for your cats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your home grows together with your family. Live in a cat paradise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4328440/extras/afac03171d7e8d63dbc3326ca33cf54e.poster.avif?t=1774263285\" width=640 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4328440/extras/afac03171d7e8d63dbc3326ca33cf54e.webm?t=1774263285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4328440/extras/afac03171d7e8d63dbc3326ca33cf54e.mp4?t=1774263285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE OTHER FAMILIES HAPPY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every cat stays forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully choose adoptive families for your rescued pets and send them to loving homes - make others happy too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TEAM OF CAT PARENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are your friends kind, caring, and ready to help?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite them to your world and play together:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• rescue cats as a team</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• share responsibilities and resources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• build and manage your sanctuary together</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because saving lives is even better when you’re not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your heart is full of love. The city is full of cats who need it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save abandoned, homeless, and helpless cats. Give them care, earn their trust, and help them find a forever home - or keep them with you and build a safe sanctuary where they can live happily. Play alone or together with your own team of cat parents.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SAVE CATS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locate cats in distress on the open city map. Ride your bike on a rescue mission. Use the right tools and gadgets. Save poor, sweet little animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every rescue is unique. Every life matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4328440/extras/4839cfa7578775c48945aa38fdfd5e7b.poster.avif?t=1774263285\" width=640 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4328440/extras/4839cfa7578775c48945aa38fdfd5e7b.webm?t=1774263285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4328440/extras/4839cfa7578775c48945aa38fdfd5e7b.mp4?t=1774263285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TAKE CARE OF THEM</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring rescued cats home and give them gentle care: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• wash dirty and scared cats </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• treat illnesses </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• feed them </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• help them feel safe again</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4328440/extras/2cde11fd6247a9ce81050443010ffc43.poster.avif?t=1774263285\" width=640 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4328440/extras/2cde11fd6247a9ce81050443010ffc43.webm?t=1774263285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4328440/extras/2cde11fd6247a9ce81050443010ffc43.mp4?t=1774263285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR CAT PARADISE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your home into a true cat sanctuary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• build climbing structures, tunnels, beds, and houses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• decorate and expand your space</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• create a cozy, living ecosystem for your cats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your home grows together with your family. Live in a cat paradise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4328440/extras/afac03171d7e8d63dbc3326ca33cf54e.poster.avif?t=1774263285\" width=640 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4328440/extras/afac03171d7e8d63dbc3326ca33cf54e.webm?t=1774263285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4328440/extras/afac03171d7e8d63dbc3326ca33cf54e.mp4?t=1774263285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE OTHER FAMILIES HAPPY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every cat stays forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully choose adoptive families for your rescued pets and send them to loving homes - make others happy too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TEAM OF CAT PARENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are your friends kind, caring, and ready to help?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite them to your world and play together:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• rescue cats as a team</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• share responsibilities and resources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• build and manage your sanctuary together</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because saving lives is even better when you’re not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "FROM STRAY TO HOME: cat rescue simulator. The streets are full of dangers for these sweet, defenseless creatures. Save cats, give them love, care, and a place to call home. Become a true cat parent alone or with your friend. Discover what true happiness feels like.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Finnish, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietname